      "da": "Ordet people (\\\"folk / mennesker\\\") tager altid flertalsudsagnsord (people are), mens news (\\\"nyheder\\\") altid tager ental (news is).",
      "en": "\"People\" always takes a plural verb (people are), whereas \"news\" always takes singular (news is).",
